```

The compiled admission adds the missing-evidence map. The public packet does not yet preserve:

- eligible real population and exposure assignment;
- complete considered and rejected option set;
- option origin, coalition, amendment, or objective-challenge history;
- publisher-side protocol and attributed approval owner;
